00:02:20.304 --> 00:02:23.239
NOW THIS WILL GET WORSE.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:27.377
&gt;&gt; IT'S A TEXTBOOK CASE OF

00:02:27.378 --> 00:02:30.947
